==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite Nyandam being the boss, the main threats here are the Bores, especially Razorback. Make sure of bringing units to [[Slow|slow]] or [[Freeze|freeze]] them. Also, try to kill the Bore quickly, or else you'll have to fight Bore and Razorback together, making the battle really difficult to fight against.

[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] are almost essential for this stage. [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] is also highly recommended. If you have these 3 cats, fill the rest of the slots with 2-4 meatshields and several high damage attackers ([[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|A. Bahamut]] is good for several hits on Galactic Overseer Nyandam, and [[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Lufalan Pasalan]] is good for damaging the Bores). Notably, the stage can be rushed before the Razorback has a chance to spawn.

